{
  "slug": "datarails-financeos",
  "name": "Datarails Financeos",
  "type": "plugin",
  "description": "Datarails FinanceOS plugin for financial planning and analysis - 17 skills, 8 commands, 8 agents with remote MCP connector for Datarails platform.",
  "longDescription": "Ships **19 skills**, **4 commands** and **1 MCP server**.\n\n- **Skills** (19): `anomalies` (Detect data anomalies in one Datarails Finance OS table and answer IN CHAT — severity-ranked outliers, duplicates, missing/null…), `anomalies-report` (Detect data anomalies and generate a comprehensive data-quality Excel WORKBOOK from Finance OS tables, computed over the table's…), `audit` (Generate an audit-support evidence package over FinanceOS data - completeness, reconciliation, mapping-integrity, and substantive-sample checks with a PDF…), `dashboard` (Executive KPI dashboard — a ONE-MONTH metrics snapshot for the latest closed month (not real-time; the in-progress month…), `departments` (Analyze P&L and performance by department), `drilldown` (Drill down on a cell in the Datarails Excel Add-in to see underlying detail — also the skill…), `expense-analysis` (Top expense categories, monthly expense trends, and concentration analysis from real aggregated data), `extract` (Extract validated financial data from Datarails Finance OS to Excel — a RAW FULL-YEAR export — a 4-sheet…), and 11 more\n- **Commands** (4): `budget-comparison` (Compare actual results to budget - see where you're over or under plan using complete aggregated data), `data-check` (Check your financial data for quality issues - missing values, anomalies, and inconsistencies), `explore-tables` (Explore what data is available in your Datarails account — server-side catalog via the MCP connector; correct even…), `test-api` (Test API field compatibility and performance - discover which fields work with aggregation and report the compatibility map)\n- **MCP servers** (1): `datarails-finance-os`\n\nInstalls with `claude plugin install datarails-financeos@claude-community` from `Datarails/dr-claude-code-plugins-re`.",
